Ms. Gauthier,</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;=
, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" cl=
ass=3D"elementToProof">
Both estimates arrived this afternoon, eight minutes apart. My response to =
both is attached.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;=
, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" cl=
ass=3D"elementToProof">
I dispute both. I am not paying either one, and I am not narrowing either r=
equest. I do not pay for records I have a right to see.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;=
, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" cl=
ass=3D"elementToProof">
Neither estimate answers the fee waiver I requested under ORS 192.324(5) on=
 September 5. That request is still pending and it requires a written deter=
mination. The authority to make it belongs to the custodian, which is the D=
irector, not to External Relations.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;=
, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" cl=
ass=3D"elementToProof">
Director Sumption is copied here, as she was copied on the request. She is =
also its subject. Items 1 and 3 seek her own communications. The waiver is =
hers to grant.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;=
, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" cl=
ass=3D"elementToProof">
One item is not a fee question. On the September 11 request, item 2 is answ=
ered &quot;This is not a record we have,&quot; on the same page where item =
1 agrees to produce the SharePoint or OneDrive version histories of that do=
cument. A version history is a record of saves
 with the date, time, and account for each. If that answer stands, state it=
 as a denial, identify who made it, and state the search performed.</div>
<div style=3D"direction: ltr; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; font-fam=
ily: Aptos, &quot;Aptos_EmbeddedFont&quot;, &quot;Aptos_MSFontService&quot;=
, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);" cl=
ass=3D"elementToProof">
There will be no negotiation of scope, no call, and no meeting. Produce the=
 records the public has a right to see. Or don't, and continue to show what=
 kind of institution you are.</div>
